# Project agent-core overlay (optional)

If your project already has an alwaysApply agent-core rule (e.g. `project-agent-core.mdc`), copy relevant bullets below. Do not duplicate full Confirm text — link to the package rules.

## Before coding (add under 动手前 / Before coding)

1. Read **`AGENTS.md`** at project root first (`.cursor/rules/workspace-agent-gate.mdc`).
2. If Implement may touch shared utils: first assistant message includes **Confirm (Q1–Q5) + Verdict（最终）** in chat; read util **source** before deciding (`.cursor/rules/utils-reuse-gate.mdc`).

## Do not

- Skip `AGENTS.md` because rules summarized it
- Skip Confirm because WIP already imports utils
- Write `.utils-discovery-cache.json`

Default Hook is **remind** only. Optional `hookMode: confirm` — see package README.
